* text=auto eol=lf

# MEDIA IS BINARY, AND SAYING SO IS NOT OPTIONAL.
#
# The line above hands every file to a content HEURISTIC to decide whether it
# is text.  For source that is what we want — build.sh breaks under CRLF, which
# is why that rule is there at all.  For a 70MB AAC file it is a coin toss that
# nothing in this repo could ever call wrong: a media file that lost it would be
# rewritten on checkout, and there is no test here that can hear, and no suite
# that fetches media at all.  Name them instead of trusting the guess.
#
# .glb is on this list before a single model has arrived (docs/MODELING.md), on
# the same reasoning: the import fallback is SILENT by design, so a corrupted
# model would simply never load and never say why.
*.m4a binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.glb binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
